   "address": "<p>Henry R. Kravis Hall 655 W 130th St, New York, NY 10027</p>",
   "description": "<p>Located in the Henry R. Kravis Hall at Columbia Business School, the Robert F. Smith Dining Hall is the go-to eatery for business school students, staff, and faculty.</p><p>Open Monday \u2013 Thursday, 8:00 a.m. \u2013 4:30 p.m.,&nbsp; Friday 8:00 a.m. - 4:00 p.m. with food service available at the following times:</p><ul><li>Continental breakfast: 8:00 a.m. \u2013 11:00 a.m.</li><li>Lunch: 11:00 a.m. \u2013 2:00 p.m.</li><li>Snacks &amp; grab-and-go items: 2:00 p.m. \u2013 4:00/4:30 p.m.</li><li>Coffee bar: all day</li></ul><p><em>This location does not accept Columbia Dining meal swipes. Payment is by Flex or credit card only</em>.</p><p><em><strong>Menus are subject to change. For the most accurate allergen information, refer to the printed in-unit menus.</strong></em></p>",
