   "type": "cu_dining_location",
   "title": "The Fac Shack",
   "address": "",
   "description": "<p>Located in the Wien Courtyard, the Fac Shack food truck is a convenient, grab-and-go lunch option on east campus. This location offers a set number of items in exchange for a meal swipe, or payable by Dining Dollars, Flex, or credit card. Lunch includes an entr\u00e9e, hand fruit, dessert, and water (refill station).</p><p><strong>New, Spring 2026:</strong> You asked for more variety at Fac Shack, and we hear you. This spring semester, Fac Shack will embark on a culinary <a href=\"/news/fac-shack-goes-global-and-fourth-floor-dining-opens-faculty-house\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"8e7a87bc-b355-4dc0-9a77-1cbf469b2cd7\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">World Tour</a>, featuring a new global cuisine each week! The rotating menu will spotlight dishes from around the world, giving students something new to look forward to every time they stop by.</p><p><em><strong>Menus are subject to change. For the most accurate allergen information, refer to the printed in-unit menus.</strong></em></p>",
